{"ID":"20230928083527-ln5jjor","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928083527-ln5jjor","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083527-ln5jjor\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083533-35wbfs9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083613-wg6pmey\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083613-wg6pmey\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【手少阳三焦经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173900"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912165511-7smazjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912165511-7smazjn","updated":"20240912173854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【手少阳三焦经穴位】：关冲穴、液门穴、中渚穴、阳池穴、外关穴、支沟穴、会宗穴、三阳络穴、四渎穴、天井穴、清冷渊穴、消泺穴、臑会穴、肩髎穴、天髎穴、天牖穴、翳风穴、瘈脉穴、颅息穴、角孙穴、耳门穴、耳和髎穴、丝竹空穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-35wbfs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-35wbfs9","updated":"20230928083536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦经，分为上焦，中焦，下焦，跟心包经是表里经；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-e1wov2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-e1wov2d","updated":"20230928083537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦，决渎之官，水道出焉；水道是三焦在管（膀胱经是州都之官，津液出焉）；如腹水，身体肿胀，说明三焦经堵了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-fchpxck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-fchpxck","updated":"20230928083537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"打坐时，当心神平静安定时，气会顺着三焦散布到全身四肢，当有欲望淫欲时，三焦气会慢慢集中到命门，以此力量达到高潮；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-uh3ezwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-uh3ezwj","updated":"20230928083538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦经贯通脏腑，脏如心、肝、脾、肺、肾、心包，腑如胆、小肠、胃、大肠、膀胱；脏腑之间交接沟通协调 ，靠的就是三焦经，所以病邪在脏入腑时，脏腑相互抗争，就会出现忽冷忽热的现象；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-b0hjj3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-b0hjj3c","updated":"20230928083540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t金\t关冲穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-dqhoope","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-dqhoope","updated":"20230928083539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t水\t液门穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-j2k22mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-j2k22mg","updated":"20230928083540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t木\t中渚穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-gj4b61e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-gj4b61e","updated":"20230928083541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t火\t支沟穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-wkww95d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-wkww95d","updated":"20230928083542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t土\t天井穴（手弯起来天井穴才会露出 ）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083533-rrjem3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083533-rrjem3o","updated":"20230928083542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"外关穴，手少阳三焦经络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083543-rat4lk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083543-rat4lk5"}},{"ID":"20230928083534-r6op82f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083534-r6op82f"}},{"ID":"20230928083606-7ekpr7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083606-7ekpr7q","updated":"20230928083606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手少阳三焦经"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手少阳三焦经-20230928083606-d0edzri.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928083609-0213eo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083609-0213eo6","updated":"20230928083609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手少阳三焦经1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手少阳三焦经1-20230928083609-hsruycj.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928083613-wg6pmey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083613-wg6pmey","updated":"20230928083613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手少阳三焦经2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手少阳三焦经2-20230928083613-xyu3nw6.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240912173859-se2xguf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240912173859-se2xguf"}},{"ID":"20240912173900-rvh8hw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912173900-rvh8hw2"}}]}